# This file only applies to image builds whose context is the repository root.
# Today that is mcp-server: its image ships the product documentation, which
# lives outside the service directory. Every other service builds from its own
# directory and is filtered by its own .dockerignore.
*

!docs
!mcp-server

docs/**/pics

mcp-server/bin
mcp-server/.task
mcp-server/.helm
mcp-server/README.md
